question, Bailiff.

940
00:14:48.041 --> 00:14:49.125
And in the court's view,

941
00:14:49.125 --> 00:14:50.708
the central question.

942
00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:51.583
Lord Octavius

943
00:14:51.583 --> 00:14:52.375
has argued at length

944
00:14:52.375 --> 00:14:53.041
that supporters

945
00:14:53.041 --> 00:14:54.500
are entitled to speak.

946
00:14:54.541 --> 00:14:55.125
The Plaintiffs

947
00:14:55.125 --> 00:14:55.583
have argued

948
00:14:55.583 --> 00:14:56.041
that many of

949
00:14:56.041 --> 00:14:56.708
those supporters

950
00:14:56.708 --> 00:14:57.500
were not supporters

951
00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.250
at all.

952
00:14:58.291 --> 00:14:58.791
The court

953
00:14:58.791 --> 00:14:59.791
must therefore determine

954
00:14:59.791 --> 00:15:00.291
whether it is

955
00:15:00.291 --> 00:15:01.666
evaluating public opinion

956
00:15:01.666 --> 00:15:02.833
or a manufactured

957
00:15:02.833 --> 00:15:04.375
approximation of it.

958
00:15:04.416 --> 00:15:05.375
Lord Octavius,

959
00:15:05.375 --> 00:15:05.958
before the court

960
00:15:05.958 --> 00:15:06.958
renders judgment,

961
00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.041
it invites you to address

962
00:15:08.041 --> 00:15:09.208
one final concern:

963
00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.333
at what point does

964
00:15:10.375 --> 00:15:11.250
amplification cease

965
00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:12.333
to reflect public opinion

966
00:15:12.333 --> 00:15:13.250
and begin to shape it?

967
00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:13.625
Your Honor,

968
00:15:13.625 --> 00:15:14.791
I reject the premise.

969
00:15:14.833 --> 00:15:16.000
Nothing was amplified.

970
00:15:16.333 --> 00:15:16.625
AeroGram

971
00:15:16.625 --> 00:15:17.541
does not attach

972
00:15:17.541 --> 00:15:18.625
steam engines to ideas

973
00:15:18.625 --> 00:15:19.750
and make them louder.

974
00:15:19.791 --> 00:15:20.958
It recommends content

975
00:15:20.958 --> 00:15:21.500
based on the

976
00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.750
user's preferences.

977
00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.291
If somebody

978
00:15:23.291 --> 00:15:24.500
enjoys statistics,

979
00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.916
they see statistics.

980
00:15:25.958 --> 00:15:26.375
If somebody

981
00:15:26.375 --> 00:15:27.250
enjoys predictions,

982
00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.291
they see predictions.

983
00:15:28.291 --> 00:15:28.708
If somebody

984
00:15:28.708 --> 00:15:29.500
enjoys rivalries,

985
00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:30.458
they see rivalries.

986
00:15:30.458 --> 00:15:31.333
If somebody enjoys

987
00:15:31.333 --> 00:15:32.458
making fun of a goalkeeper

988
00:15:32.458 --> 00:15:33.750
who missed an easy save,

989
00:15:33.791 --> 00:15:34.666
they will probably see

990
00:15:34.666 --> 00:15:35.875
more of that too.

991
00:15:35.916 --> 00:15:36.833
The Plaintiffs speak

992
00:15:36.833 --> 00:15:37.083
as though

993
00:15:37.125 --> 00:15:38.083
AeroGram is telling people

994
00:15:38.083 --> 00:15:38.750
what to think.

995
00:15:38.791 --> 00:15:39.375
It isn't.

996
00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:40.333
It is observing

997
00:15:40.333 --> 00:15:40.833
what people are

998
00:15:40.833 --> 00:15:41.375
interested in

999
00:15:41.375 --> 00:15:42.125
and responding

1000
00:15:42.125 --> 00:15:42.708
accordingly.

1001
00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:43.833
The recommendation system

1002
00:15:43.833 --> 00:15:44.500
did not create

1003
00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.625
those interests;

1004
00:15:45.666 --> 00:15:46.708
the users did.

1005
00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.291
As for the chat automatons,

1006
00:15:48.333 --> 00:15:48.833
they are part

1007
00:15:48.833 --> 00:15:50.333
of the same ecosystem.

1008
00:15:50.333 --> 00:15:51.458
Some people post,

1009
00:15:51.541 --> 00:15:53.000
some businesses post,

1010
00:15:53.166 --> 00:15:54.250
some advertisers

1011
00:15:54.291 --> 00:15:54.875
post,

1012
00:15:54.875 --> 00:15:56.416
some automated systems

1013
00:15:56.416 --> 00:15:57.250
post.

1014
00:15:57.291 --> 00:15:58.541
The public decides

1015
00:15:58.541 --> 00:15:59.583
what it values.

1016
00:15:59.583 --> 00:16:00.291
The Plaintiffs

1017
00:16:00.291 --> 00:16:00.958
want this court

1018
00:16:00.958 --> 00:16:01.666
to believe that

1019
00:16:01.666 --> 00:16:02.583
millions of people

1020
00:16:02.583 --> 00:16:03.791
abandoned their judgment

1021
00:16:03.791 --> 00:16:04.750
and surrendered

1022
00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:05.416
their free will

1023
00:16:05.458 --> 00:16:06.583
to a recommendation

1024
00:16:06.583 --> 00:16:07.208
engine.

1025
00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.125
I think

1026
00:16:08.125 --> 00:16:09.125
the public deserves

1027
00:16:09.125 --> 00:16:10.541
more credit than that.

1028
00:16:10.583 --> 00:16:11.375
Technology

1029
00:16:11.375 --> 00:16:12.166
did not make these

1030
00:16:12.208 --> 00:16:13.500
athletes unpopular,

1031
00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.458
or make supporters

1032
00:16:14.458 --> 00:16:15.708
argue or invent

1033
00:16:15.708 --> 00:16:17.000
predictions, gambling

1034
00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.708
rivalries and trash talk.

1035
00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:19.750
It merely made them

1036
00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.875
easier to find.

1037
00:16:20.916 --> 00:16:22.041
And if the Plaintiffs

1038
00:16:22.041 --> 00:16:23.125
dislike what people found,

1039
00:16:23.166 --> 00:16:23.500
perhaps

1040
00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.000
the problem is

1041
00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.083
not the recommendation.

1042
00:16:25.125 --> 00:16:26.166
Perhaps the problem

1043
00:16:26.166 --> 00:16:27.125
is what people chose

1044
00:16:27.125 --> 00:16:27.625
to recommend

1045
00:16:27.625 --> 00:16:28.458
for themselves.

1046
00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.375
The court is prepared

1047
00:16:29.375 --> 00:16:30.041
to rule.

1048
00:16:30.041 --> 00:16:30.875
This case has raised

1049
00:16:30.875 --> 00:16:31.708
important questions

1050
00:16:31.708 --> 00:16:32.625
regarding speech,

1051
00:16:32.625 --> 00:16:34.000
technology, competition,

1052
00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:34.916
and the increasingly

1053
00:16:34.916 --> 00:16:35.666
blurred distinction

1054
00:16:35.666 --> 00:16:36.375
between predicting

1055
00:16:36.375 --> 00:16:37.291
human behavior

1056
00:16:37.291 --> 00:16:38.666
and influencing it.

1057
00:16:38.666 --> 00:16:39.625
At the outset,

1058
00:16:39.625 --> 00:16:40.333
the court rejects

1059
00:16:40.333 --> 00:16:41.000
the proposition

1060
00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.375
that criticism, rivalry,

1061
00:16:42.375 --> 00:16:43.333
predictions, gambling

1062
00:16:43.333 --> 00:16:44.458
recommendations, or public

1063
00:16:44.458 --> 00:16:44.875
discussion

1064
00:16:44.875 --> 00:16:46.458
are inherently unlawful.

1065
00:16:46.583 --> 00:16:47.333
A free society

1066
00:16:47.333 --> 00:16:48.250
must tolerate speech

1067
00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.125
that is persuasive,

1068
00:16:49.166 --> 00:16:49.708
irritating,

1069
00:16:49.708 --> 00:16:50.958
inaccurate, exaggerated,

1070
00:16:50.958 --> 00:16:52.333
and occasionally absurd.

1071
00:16:52.375 --> 00:16:53.000
The law does not

1072
00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:53.791
prohibit supporters

1073
00:16:53.791 --> 00:16:54.375
from expressing

1074
00:16:54.375 --> 00:16:55.708
opinions, bookmakers

1075
00:16:55.708 --> 00:16:56.833
from setting odds,

1076
00:16:56.875 --> 00:16:57.583
or technology

1077
00:16:57.583 --> 00:16:57.958
companies

1078
00:16:57.958 --> 00:16:59.083
from recommending content

1079
00:16:59.083 --> 00:16:59.541
based upon

1080
00:16:59.541 --> 00:17:00.666
user preferences.

1081
00:17:00.708 --> 00:17:01.083
The court

1082
00:17:01.083 --> 00:17:01.750
therefore rejects

1083
00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:02.375
any suggestion

1084
00:17:02.375 --> 00:17:03.375
that Lord Octavius

1085
00:17:03.375 --> 00:17:04.250
incurred liability

1086
00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.083
merely because AeroGram

1087
00:17:05.083 --> 00:17:05.750
influenced

1088
00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.666
what people saw,

1089
00:17:06.708 --> 00:17:07.125
or because

1090
00:17:07.125 --> 00:17:08.041
QuantUs influenced

1091
00:17:08.083 --> 00:17:09.166
what people discussed.

1092
00:17:09.208 --> 00:17:09.666
As to the

1093
00:17:09.666 --> 00:17:10.416
coordinated chat

1094
00:17:10.416 --> 00:17:11.291
automaton networks

1095
00:17:11.291 --> 00:17:11.958
identified through

1096
00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.208
forensic analysis,

1097
00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.208
the evidence established

1098
00:17:14.208 --> 00:17:14.958
that those networks

1099
00:17:14.958 --> 00:17:16.125
existed and disseminated

1100
00:17:16.125 --> 00:17:17.083
misleading information

1101
00:17:17.083 --> 00:17:18.583
regarding athletes, clubs,

1102
00:17:18.583 --> 00:17:19.333
and competitive

1103
00:17:19.333 --> 00:17:20.041
performance.

1104
00:17:20.041 --> 00:17:20.625
However, while

1105
00:17:20.625 --> 00:17:21.291
the infrastructure

1106
00:17:21.333 --> 00:17:22.250
supporting those networks

1107
00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:22.666
was traced

1108
00:17:22.666 --> 00:17:24.416
to Lord Octavius' province,

1109
00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.041
the Plaintiffs

1110
00:17:25.041 --> 00:17:25.708
did not establish

1111
00:17:25.708 --> 00:17:26.125
that Lord

1112
00:17:26.125 --> 00:17:27.000
Octavius directed,

1113
00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:27.958
controlled, commissioned,

1114
00:17:27.958 --> 00:17:29.125
or knowingly participated

1115
00:17:29.125 --> 00:17:30.083
in those activities.

1116
00:17:30.125 --> 00:17:30.958
Accordingly, the court

1117
00:17:30.958 --> 00:17:31.875
finds in favor of Lord

1118
00:17:31.916 --> 00:17:33.458
Octavius on that issue.

1119
00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.208
That does not end

1120
00:17:34.208 --> 00:17:35.083
the matter.

1121
00:17:35.125 --> 00:17:36.250
Lord Octavius acknowledged

1122
00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.333
that he owned QuantUs,

1123
00:17:37.375 --> 00:17:38.000
promoted it

1124
00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:38.333
throughout the

1125
00:17:38.333 --> 00:17:39.250
Imperial Cup,

1126
00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:39.875
and purchased

1127
00:17:39.875 --> 00:17:40.666
advertising space

1128
00:17:40.666 --> 00:17:41.750
to display its forecast

1129
00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.125
during active competition.

1130
00:17:43.125 --> 00:17:43.625
The evidence

1131
00:17:43.625 --> 00:17:44.416
further demonstrated

1132
00:17:44.416 --> 00:17:45.250
that those forecasts

1133
00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:45.875
were repeatedly

1134
00:17:45.875 --> 00:17:46.375
presented through

1135
00:17:46.375 --> 00:17:47.541
communication channels

1136
00:17:47.541 --> 00:17:48.166
and advertising

1137
00:17:48.166 --> 00:17:48.916
infrastructure over

1138
00:17:48.916 --> 00:17:49.333
which Lord

1139
00:17:49.333 --> 00:17:50.375
Octavius exercised

1140
00:17:50.375 --> 00:17:51.958
substantial influence.

1141
00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.125
The court is not persuaded

1142
00:17:53.125 --> 00:17:53.875
that this arrangement

1143
00:17:53.875 --> 00:17:54.958
was merely an exercise

1144
00:17:54.958 --> 00:17:55.708
of speech.

1145
00:17:56.583 --> 00:17:57.916
Predictions, advertising,

1146
00:17:57.916 --> 00:17:58.750
and recommendations

1147
00:17:58.750 --> 00:17:59.458
may be lawful,

1148
00:17:59.458 --> 00:18:00.583
but when a single actor

1149
00:18:00.583 --> 00:18:01.666
simultaneously controls

1150
00:18:01.666 --> 00:18:02.708
the predictive system,

1151
00:18:02.708 --> 00:18:03.416
the principal means

1152
00:18:03.416 --> 00:18:04.208
of distribution,

1153
00:18:04.208 --> 00:18:04.583
and the

1154
00:18:04.583 --> 00:18:05.708
promotional infrastructure

1155
00:18:05.708 --> 00:18:05.916
through

1156
00:18:05.958 --> 00:18:06.750
which those predictions

1157
00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:07.916
are repeatedly delivered,

1158
00:18:07.958 --> 00:18:08.875
the court must consider

1159
00:18:08.875 --> 00:18:10.000
not merely the message,

1160
00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:10.875
but the concentration

1161
00:18:10.875 --> 00:18:12.458
of power behind it.

1162
00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:13.416
Lord Octavius

1163
00:18:13.416 --> 00:18:13.708
was not

1164
00:18:13.708 --> 00:18:14.541
merely participating

1165
00:18:14.541 --> 00:18:15.250
in the marketplace

1166
00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:15.958
of ideas.

1167
00:18:15.958 --> 00:18:17.000
He occupied a uniquely

1168
00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:17.791
privileged position

1169
00:18:17.791 --> 00:18:18.291
within it,

1170
00:18:18.333 --> 00:18:19.083
one unavailable

1171
00:18:19.083 --> 00:18:20.041
to competing clubs,

1172
00:18:20.083 --> 00:18:21.541
athletes, or sponsors.

1173
00:18:21.583 --> 00:18:22.000
The court,

1174
00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:22.583
therefore finds

1175
00:18:22.583 --> 00:18:23.625
that Lord Octavius

1176
00:18:23.625 --> 00:18:24.666
used his dominant position

1177
00:18:24.666 --> 00:18:25.333
across multiple

1178
00:18:25.333 --> 00:18:26.250
interconnected systems

1179
00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.083
to create an unfair

1180
00:18:27.083 --> 00:18:27.916
competitive advantage

1181
00:18:27.916 --> 00:18:29.125
during the Imperial Cup.

1182
00:18:29.166 --> 00:18:30.166
This finding does not rest

1183
00:18:30.166 --> 00:18:30.500
upon the

1184
00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.583
predictions themselves,

1185
00:18:31.583 --> 00:18:32.375
but rather upon

1186
00:18:32.375 --> 00:18:33.041
the concentration

1187
00:18:33.041 --> 00:18:33.500
of control

1188
00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.250
surrounding them.

1189
00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.041
The court declines

1190
00:18:35.041 --> 00:18:35.583
to hold Lord

1191
00:18:35.583 --> 00:18:36.583
Octavius responsible

1192
00:18:36.583 --> 00:18:37.416
for every rumor,

1193
00:18:37.416 --> 00:18:38.375
prediction, insult,

1194
00:18:38.375 --> 00:18:39.291
or automated message

1195
00:18:39.291 --> 00:18:39.750
that appeared

1196
00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:40.583
during the Cup.

1197
00:18:40.625 --> 00:18:40.958
It does,

1198
00:18:40.958 --> 00:18:41.625
however, hold him

1199
00:18:41.625 --> 00:18:42.125
responsible

1200
00:18:42.125 --> 00:18:42.708
for the conduct

1201
00:18:42.708 --> 00:18:43.666
he openly admitted.

1202
00:18:43.666 --> 00:18:44.208
Accordingly,

1203
00:18:44.208 --> 00:18:45.083
judgment is entered

1204
00:18:45.083 --> 00:18:45.666
for the Plaintiffs

1205
00:18:45.666 --> 00:18:46.583
on the claim of unfair

1206
00:18:46.583 --> 00:18:47.666
competitive interference

1207
00:18:47.666 --> 00:18:48.166
arising from

1208
00:18:48.166 --> 00:18:48.958
that concentration

1209
00:18:48.958 --> 00:18:49.791
of control.

1210
00:18:49.791 --> 00:18:50.583
There's nothing wrong

1211
00:18:50.583 --> 00:18:52.000
with being a fan,

1212
00:18:52.041 --> 00:18:52.791
just as long

1213
00:18:52.791 --> 00:18:53.708
as the stadium

1214
00:18:53.708 --> 00:18:55.291
has more than one exit.

1215
00:18:55.416 --> 00:18:56.583
Indeed, predictions

1216
00:18:56.583 --> 00:18:57.916
may describe the future.

1217
00:18:57.916 --> 00:18:59.083
They may not be inserted

1218
00:18:59.083 --> 00:18:59.791
into the machinery

1219
00:18:59.791 --> 00:19:00.541
of competition

1220
00:19:00.541 --> 00:19:01.125
for the purpose

1221
00:19:01.125 --> 00:19:02.625
of helping create it.

1222
00:19:02.666 --> 00:19:04.125
This court is adjourned.

1223
00:19:05.583 --> 00:19:06.000
Do you

1224
00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.041
agree with Judge GPT's

1225
00:19:08.041 --> 00:19:09.041
verdict?

1226
00:19:09.166 --> 00:19:11.333
Exercise your civic duty,

1227
00:19:11.541 --> 00:19:13.083
join the virtual jury,

1228
00:19:13.083 --> 00:19:14.875
and hit the "like" button.

1229
00:19:14.916 --> 00:19:16.625
Or leave a comment saying

1230
00:19:16.666 --> 00:19:18.333
how YOU would have ruled

1231
00:19:18.375 --> 00:19:19.625
in this case.

1232
00:19:19.666 --> 00:19:21.291
Subscribe now for

1233
00:19:21.333 --> 00:19:22.583
more content.
